    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Star was originally called Hunsucker's Store, named after the trading post of its first landowner.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Star%2C_North_Carolina"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The timber industry was the first major factor driving Star's early growth.",
